cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TPMS 3D Curve Mapping: curve networks on analytic TPMS level sets"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB tools for 3D curve mapping on triply periodic minimal surface (TPMS)
  lattices, currently implemented for the gyroid. They trace lines of curvature
  and asymptotic curves directly on the analytic level set and report
  curve-network metrics (straightness,
  direction memory, loop closure, geodesic curvature, torsion and handedness),
  together with wall thickness, solid fraction and surface-to-volume ratio as
  functions of the level-set value.
type: software
